{"1841660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "nanos world™", "steam_appid": 1841660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on Discord!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/9374db8b57542aa658c36c1b4e910faa.avif?t=1780482593\" width=620 height=132 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Updates</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/0f0b2b80230a3921fa8a507029a75b1c.avif?t=1780482593\" width=108 height=200 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/5d9ad1f854fec717815a8369adc9de8c.avif?t=1780482593\" width=84 height=200 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/66fb3d0cb5d7a3c2cd252771fcaf93ce.avif?t=1780482593\" width=80 height=200 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/284af37dbe0281f02c45373cdd44a9a4.avif?t=1780482593\" width=80 height=200 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/6c3d20ddfd4caef7f8c7bfd19dbf490a.avif?t=1780482593\" width=72 height=200 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/5072d10d77cbd320a864a802cdf806fb.avif?t=1780482593\" width=114 height=200 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/c31bd167d178bd7b0b90b2bfbfe787b9.avif?t=1780482593\" width=84 height=200 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/87b13e976f6cbf326d11e94f2a346582.avif?t=1780482593\" width=131 height=200 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><strong>nanos world</strong> is the next-generation open world multiplayer sandbox. Inspired by the golden age of creative gaming such as <i>Garry's Mod</i>, <i>SA-MP</i> and <i>FiveM</i>, it provides the ultimate platform for players to enjoy unlimited variety and for creators to build their visions with the full power of <strong>Lua</strong> &amp; <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong>.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 LIMITLESS SANDBOX FREEDOM</h2>Whether you want to join a hardcore Roleplay (RP) server, compete in tactical shooters, or just mess around with physics-based contraptions, nanos world is whatever you make of it. With no predefined goals, the only limit is your imagination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ BUILD WITH UNREAL ENGINE 5</h2>nanos world gives you direct access to modern engine features. Import your own FBX models, custom maps, and assets directly from the latest version of <strong>Unreal Engine 5</strong> into the game.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/f2b0e70903ca64bd1427a673e080b46d.avif?t=1780482593\" width=620 height=116 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤖 POWERFUL LUA SCRIPTING</h2>We provide a fast, intuitive scripting API and a modern game-play framework, so you can focus on creativity instead of boilerplate code. Our complete <strong>Official Documentation</strong> provides everything you need to learn and start creating your packages right away! Created by developers for developers.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/034dc3f5ad6ee43fc26b3caf67071c55.avif?t=1780482593\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎈 THE ULTIMATE MULTIPLAYER EXPERIENCE</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Own Networking</strong>: we built a totally custom networking layer, proving an extremely lightweight server that handles thousands of entities spawned at the same time.<br></li><li> <strong>Native Multiplayer</strong>: everything you script is already natively synced.<br></li><li> <strong>Synchronized Physics:</strong> all the entity physics is synchronized with out network authority system.<br></li><li> <strong>Dedicated Servers:</strong> lightweight, reliable server software for Windows and Linux.<br></li><li> <strong>Built-in VOIP:</strong> for local or remote in-game talk.<br></li><li> <strong>Integrated Vault &amp; Store:</strong> Share anything you create in our integrated Vault, making easier for other players to download an play.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛍️ COMMUNITY CONTENT</h2>All Players can <strong>create, download</strong> and <strong>share</strong> their own Scripts, Packages, Addons, Maps and Models through the fully integrated <strong>Vault</strong>, which any server can easily import as UGC.<br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841660/extras/57127167f4abfacc90c969230cc52623.avif?t=1780482593\" width=620 height=160 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💡 INSPIRED BY THE GREATS</h2>nanos world takes great inspiration from the golden sandbox games such as <i>Garry's Mod</i>, <i>SA-MP</i>, <i>MTA</i> and <i>FiveM</i>. We are big fans and grew up playing these. And we now have the great ambition to create a huge successor using cutting-edge technology, providing all the tools in a simple and very efficient way!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🗝️ KEY FEATURES</h2><strong>For Players:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 🎈 Synchronized <strong>Physics</strong>!<br></li><li> 🏪 Built-in <strong>Vault</strong> &amp; <strong>Store</strong>.<br></li><li> 🤌 Pleasant <strong>Mechanics</strong>.<br></li><li> 🗺️ Really big <strong>Maps</strong>.<br></li><li> 🎮 Unlimited quality <strong>game-modes</strong>.<br></li><li> 🌊 Dynamic <strong>Water Physics</strong>.<br></li><li> 🚀 <strong>Performance</strong> Optimized.<br></li><li> 🔊 Integrated <strong>VO-IP</strong>.<br></li><li> 🐧 Runs on <strong>Linux</strong> with Proton (<i>actively tested</i>).</li></ul><br><strong>For Developers:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 🐣 Easy <strong>Scripting</strong> &amp; <strong>Modding</strong>.<br></li><li> 🧱 Import any Unreal Engine <strong>Assets</strong> &amp; <strong>Maps</strong>.<br></li><li> 📺 <strong>Web UI</strong> user interface.<br></li><li> 🤖 <strong>AI</strong> Nav Mesh/Path Finding included!<br></li><li> 🚀 Fast and reliable <strong>Dedicated Server</strong>.<br></li><li> 💾 Integrated <strong>Database</strong> connectors.<br></li><li> 🌐 All <strong>Networking</strong> already included.<br></li><li> 🕹️ <strong>Input</strong> system integrated with the Settings.<br></li><li> 🔄️ <strong>Live Reloading</strong> while developing scripts.<br></li><li> 💑 Supportive <strong>Community</strong>.<br></li><li> 👺 <strong>Bugs</strong> resolved fast.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤗 HANDSOME COMMUNITY</h2>We actively work to maintain a healthy environment in our community! All members are part of our family. We know how important it is to have an active, partnering community. No toxicity allowed! You won't be ridiculed for asking for help. We are here to help beginners become better developers!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔫 WISHLIST NOW &amp; REGISTER TO BECOME A TESTER IN OUR DISCORD!</h2>", "about_the_game": "<strong>nanos world</strong> is the next-generation open world multiplayer sandbox. Inspired b